    {
      "field": "pages[0].copy.paragraphs[0]",
      "text": "Welcome to Hebleo, the smart way to learn Hebrew. I’ve spent over ten years bringing together three kinds of experience:",
      "sha256": "6970a29a2410f78c73fe6823f5a94a52f887df631a3e064710eb25370196142a",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 19315,
          "paragraphEnd": 19436,
          "startIndex": 19315,
          "endIndex": 19435,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[0].copy.numberedList[0]",
      "text": "Learning languages independently and seeing what works first-hand.",
      "sha256": "eb5ef03eead7e4b1330c6cdc0de78fe46a1f408a706cfa55fe3c8e4b96fbac72",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 19436,
          "paragraphEnd": 19503,
          "startIndex": 19436,
          "endIndex": 19502,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[0].copy.numberedList[1]",
      "text": "Teaching Hebrew and refining my materials with each student.",
      "sha256": "4b6378728beda5a30421278909e17e22b3a29e0ecc8986f83b998d675802290d",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 19503,
          "paragraphEnd": 19564,
          "startIndex": 19503,
          "endIndex": 19563,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[0].copy.numberedList[2]",
      "text": "My M.Sc. in Cognitive Science, which helped me understand how to improve learning, especially languages.",
      "sha256": "d6faaec1a8c3a007fcabc1534a8e06853cce6ecb1b778a8f567fbda3a9fe7a5e",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 19564,
          "paragraphEnd": 19669,
          "startIndex": 19564,
          "endIndex": 19668,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[1].copy.paragraphs[0]",
      "text": "One of my students, Adam, started with no Hebrew and a similar scientific background. We tested how long it would take him to hold conversations with me in Hebrew.",
      "sha256": "bae421fa6ed3a72d7d498fec6a233de524b1bd2910b5c3452299150adcf8d0e7",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 19765,
          "paragraphEnd": 19929,
          "startIndex": 19765,
          "endIndex": 19928,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[1].copy.paragraphs[1]",
      "text": "For an English speaker, this usually takes around 500 hours. Using the method at the core of Hebleo, Adam took around 70 hours—over seven times faster.",
      "sha256": "0ab5250dc56092c4734f9328b2028354e7df9622cd8f320ef853806ae238d07b",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 19929,
          "paragraphEnd": 20081,
          "startIndex": 19929,
          "endIndex": 20080,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[1].copy.paragraphs[2]",
      "text": "Let’s try a short demonstration. These ideas can help you learn beyond this course, too.",
      "sha256": "f500240486a4506aeac93550cce7d4a61bddfb83d2d61f6a3e0c8db8b66f573d",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 20081,
          "paragraphEnd": 20170,
          "startIndex": 20081,
          "endIndex": 20169,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[2].copy.paragraphs[0]",
      "text": "Press Play to see a number for ten seconds. Remember as much as you can without writing it down. When it disappears, type what you remember.",
      "sha256": "aaa411f31dc8569c1a36c393225d3782243a97b8277797f6db76294ac496c4d3",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 20291,
          "paragraphEnd": 20432,
          "startIndex": 20291,
          "endIndex": 20431,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[2].prompt",
      "text": "What do you remember? Enter an attempt, or select Show me how.",
      "sha256": "01c7a5f7b3201e9a5dbe6f1badeb2ae638840bfcfa7e222592bf76393130770b",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 21641,
          "paragraphEnd": 21720,
          "startIndex": 21657,
          "endIndex": 21719,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[2].activity.feedback.partial",
      "text": "That was a lot of digits to hold in mind! Let me show you a way to make sense of them.",
      "sha256": "a226d5f950f52280b17cd89b6accde1b7374800f89eabe809ed6ce275289e4fa",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 21973,
          "paragraphEnd": 22105,
          "startIndex": 22017,
          "endIndex": 22103,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[2].activity.feedback.exact",
      "text": "You remembered it. Now let me show you a way to organise the same information.",
      "sha256": "6a89f7d9507578ddaaa7ad787ac5b650c011275454c016eca05fdccfe3b30ed3",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 22105,
          "paragraphEnd": 22222,
          "startIndex": 22142,
          "endIndex": 22220,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[3].copy.paragraphs[0]",
      "text": "Let’s give the same digits some meaning.",
      "sha256": "774743c5bb75aa9ff58d58e60d7c46640ad67ab8343dbce67aa8b34d7b0492d9",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 22404,
          "paragraphEnd": 22445,
          "startIndex": 22404,
          "endIndex": 22444,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[3].activity.dateContext.introduction",
      "text": "American month–day–year order:",
      "sha256": "b0834779ae6b08572742835ffbf0a8ef38cd40f26ca89f9e27a5e238e43b6b3a",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
