          "startIndex": 23023,
          "endIndex": 23053,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[3].activity.dateContext.events[0]",
      "text": "July 4, 1776 — the American Declaration of Independence.",
      "sha256": "415e98cd6283cea92012427d611fe3aa4fc46688ac06ba36613eab0c544af234",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 23054,
          "paragraphEnd": 23111,
          "startIndex": 23054,
          "endIndex": 23110,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[3].activity.dateContext.events[1]",
      "text": "September 11, 2001 — the September 11 attacks.",
      "sha256": "b9cedd95a942658eb7886b062a69d25725b225d93b80ee96b9c312eddc8a7382",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 23111,
          "paragraphEnd": 23158,
          "startIndex": 23111,
          "endIndex": 23157,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[3].activity.dateContext.transition",
      "text": "Same digits, different meaning. Three ideas help:",
      "sha256": "acf71d740fe9e9465980ffec05b35bc0b267ef2af5d262b2f6fdb503b8ddc784",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 23159,
          "paragraphEnd": 23209,
          "startIndex": 23159,
          "endIndex": 23208,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[3].activity.principles[0]",
      "text": "Chunking: Think of two meaningful dates instead of sixteen separate digits.",
      "sha256": "fe0dd236534b819c85cc5ead52e7c3bd0dd182101a88f869f6b5d4eb203da50d",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 23616,
          "paragraphEnd": 23692,
          "startIndex": 23616,
          "endIndex": 23691,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[3].activity.principles[1]",
      "text": "Logical constraints: A date limits the possibilities: months run from 01 to 12, and a day cannot be 47.",
      "sha256": "c28d6d7dc87311494b489be4cd8b240c7defbe510797ffb3965eb76a16bb0937",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 23692,
          "paragraphEnd": 23796,
          "startIndex": 23692,
          "endIndex": 23795,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[3].activity.principles[2]",
      "text": "Memory hooks: Connect new information to established old knowledge. If you know these events and their dates, they give the digits something familiar to connect to. If not, grouping and date structure can still help.",
      "sha256": "545b56d47c652325285ea9f36733b864be4358ed832d167a322b7b7c9908eed9",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 23796,
          "paragraphEnd": 24013,
          "startIndex": 23796,
          "endIndex": 24012,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "field": "pages[4].copy.paragraphs[0]",
      "text": "We’ll use all three principles, starting with memory hooks: connecting new information to established old knowledge. First, we’ll build on things you know from English. Later, we’ll connect new Hebrew concepts to Hebrew you’ve already learned.",
      "sha256": "5b1edb92292f42b81c54f6ea3c545a632f193ab3d019a3f36a713eb2b6589a6d",
      "locations": [
        {
          "tabId": "t.0",
          "paragraphStart": 24119,
          "paragraphEnd": 24363,
          "startIndex": 24119,
          "endIndex": 24362,
          "headingId": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
